MagikOS live install medium

This ISO boots a minimal live environment with the MagikOS source tree bundled
at /root/magikos. To install MagikOS on a whole disk, run:

    bash /root/magikos/installer/magikos-install --disk /dev/sda --user you

To adopt the currently running system instead, pass --existing. Network access
is required: the installer pacstraps the target from the Arch and CachyOS
repositories.